},{"type":"text","value":" is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pending"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Background loader refreshes do not change this value. Inspect each match's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isFetching"},{"type":"text","value":" field to observe foreground "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"beforeLoad"},{"type":"text","value":"/loader work and background loader work."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"matches-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"matches"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteMatchType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Array<RouteMatch>"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The match presentation currently exposed to the application."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A navigation can keep the previous presentation visible until pending UI is\npublished. Once the destination is presented, this contains its complete\nstructurally matched lane, including descendants that are still loading."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Error and not-found results also preserve the complete structurally matched\nlane. Rendering stops at the selected pending or terminal boundary; it does\nnot truncate this array."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"location-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"location"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./ParsedLocationType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParsedLocation"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The latest location that the router has parsed from the browser history. This location may not be resolved and loaded yet."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"resolvedlocation-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resolvedLocation"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./ParsedLocationType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParsedLocation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The location whose load and framework transition have settled. It is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" before the initial location resolves."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"routerstate-properties","text":"RouterState properties","level":2},{"id":"status-property","text":"status property","level":3},{"id":"isloading-property","text":"isLoading property","level":3},{"id":"matches-property","text":"matches property","level":3},{"id":"location-property","text":"location property","level":3},{"id":"resolvedlocation-property","text":"resolvedLocation property","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `RouterState` type represents the observable state of the router, including\nthe requested and resolved locations, match presentation, and foreground loading\nstatus.\n\n```tsx\ntype RouterState = {\n  status: 'pending' | 'idle'\n  isLoading: boolean\n  matches: Array<RouteMatch>\n  location: ParsedLocation\n  resolvedLocation?: ParsedLocation\n}\n```\n\n## RouterState properties\n\nThe `RouterState` type contains all of the properties that are available on the router state.\n\n### `status` property\n\n- Type: `'pending' | 'idle'`\n- The current foreground status of the router. `pending` means the requested route is still loading or waiting for its framework transition to settle.\n\n### `isLoading` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- `true` when `status` is `pending`.\n- Background loader refreshes do not change this value. Inspect each match's `isFetching` field to observe foreground `beforeLoad`/loader work and background loader work.\n\n### `matches` property\n\n- Type: [`Array<RouteMatch>`](./RouteMatchType.md)\n- The match presentation currently exposed to the application.\n- A navigation can keep the previous presentation visible until pending UI is\n  published. Once the destination is presented, this contains its complete\n  structurally matched lane, including descendants that are still loading.\n- Error and not-found results also preserve the complete structurally matched\n  lane. Rendering stops at the selected pending or terminal boundary; it does\n  not truncate this array.\n\n### `location` property\n\n- Type: [`ParsedLocation`](./ParsedLocationType.md)\n- The latest location that the router has parsed from the browser history. This location may not be resolved and loaded yet.\n\n### `resolvedLocation` property\n\n- Type: [`ParsedLocation`](./ParsedLocationType.md) | `undefined`\n- The location whose load and framework transition have settled. It is `undefined` before the initial location resolves.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: RouterStateType\ntitle: RouterState type\n---\n\nThe `RouterState` type represents the observable state of the router, including\nthe requested and resolved locations, match presentation, and foreground loading\nstatus.\n\n```tsx\ntype RouterState = {\n  status: 'pending' | 'idle'\n  isLoading: boolean\n  matches: Array<RouteMatch>\n  location: ParsedLocation\n  resolvedLocation?: ParsedLocation\n}\n```\n\n## RouterState properties\n\nThe `RouterState` type contains all of the properties that are available on the router state.\n\n### `status` property\n\n- Type: `'pending' | 'idle'`\n- The current foreground status of the router. `pending` means the requested route is still loading or waiting for its framework transition to settle.\n\n### `isLoading` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- `true` when `status` is `pending`.\n- Background loader refreshes do not change this value. Inspect each match's `isFetching` field to observe foreground `beforeLoad`/loader work and background loader work.\n\n### `matches` property\n\n- Type: [`Array<RouteMatch>`](./RouteMatchType.md)\n- The match presentation currently exposed to the application.\n- A navigation can keep the previous presentation visible until pending UI is\n  published. Once the destination is presented, this contains its complete\n  structurally matched lane, including descendants that are still loading.\n- Error and not-found results also preserve the complete structurally matched\n  lane. Rendering stops at the selected pending or terminal boundary; it does\n  not truncate this array.\n\n### `location` property\n\n- Type: [`ParsedLocation`](./ParsedLocationType.md)\n- The latest location that the router has parsed from the browser history. This location may not be resolved and loaded yet.\n\n### `resolvedLocation` property\n\n- Type: [`ParsedLocation`](./ParsedLocationType.md) | `undefined`\n- The location whose load and framework transition have settled. It is `undefined` before the initial location resolves.\n"}
